#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`layer` ∈ {L0, L1, L2, L3, L4} — *where in the hierarchy does this page "
"sit?*"
msgstr "`layer` ∈ {L0, L1, L2, L3, L4} —— * 这个页面位于层级结构的哪里？ *"

